        1   using ibs.th.bge.1crn.subjects.subjects.
        2   using ibs.th.bge.1crn.subjects.kass-book.
        3   block-level on error undo, throw.
        4   class ibs.th.bge.1crn.import.impkass-book implements ibs.th.bge.1crn.import.iimpsubject:
        5   define temp-table tt-cashbook like ub.CashBook
        6     field stat              as character
        7     field mark              as character
        8     field basic-kb          as logical
        9     field SourceCode        as character
       10     field BankRecip-host    as integer
       11     field BankRecip-code    as integer
       12     field BankRecip-acct    as character
       13     field BankDepos-host    as integer
       14     field BankDepos-code    as integer
       15     field CountCollect-type as character
       16     field CountCollect-code as integer
       17     field CountCash-type    as character
       18     field CountCash-code    as integer
       19     field BasisIncas        as character
       20     field CorrAcctIncas     as character
       21     field Corr-transf       as character
       22     field rule-osn-transf   as character
       23     field contr-type-transf as character
