       25     field Vnecli-type       as character
       26     field Vnecli-code       as integer
       27     field Avanscli-type     as character
       28     field Avanscli-code     as integer
       29     field rule-payer-transf as character
       30     field rule-payer-rko    as character
       31     field rule-payer-inkass as character
       32     field corrPkoVne        as character
       33     field takenfromVne      as character
       34     field RuleOsnPkoVne     as character
